# P2 brightness on a held "dx brass" note: swept 128 -> 0 (darker: modulators down 24 dB), 0 -> 255 (12 dB up, more
# feedback grit), back to 128; then the same on "strings" an octave lower. Carriers never change: the level holds.
tempo 100
steps 32
tail 2.5
track lead
preset 92 128 0 0 255 70 0 0 128 0 128 190 0 0 0 0 0 0
sweep p2 128 0 0 5
sweep p2 0 255 5 11
sweep p2 255 128 11 15
note 0 E3 15 127
param p1 140 16
param p2 128 16
sweep p2 128 255 17 24
sweep p2 255 0 24 31
note 16 E2 16 100
expect sound 0 32
expect idle 46
expect peak_below -6
